Z||000000||mrgone||06-10-2001||01:15 PM||||i noticed my overflow tank was really low, so i poured in a thing of coolent and about 2L of water<BR>i got the thermostat out, rear cap back on, and front cap off.<P>i dont want to disconnect the coolent line to burp the system <P>will doing it this way help at all?||||reg||1
